{"seq":49,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f00621"},"reason":"The answer 'tief in die Tasche greifen' was wrong: Duden defines it as 'für etwas viel zahlen'. The saying the referee's-pockets story (yellow in the breast pocket, red in the back pocket, black-and-white TV) explains is 'die Arschkarte ziehen' — Duden: 'wohl nach dem Umstand, dass früher die Fußballschiedsrichter die Rote Karte in der Gesäßtasche trugen'. Answers EN/DE/RU and the source now name it.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.duden.de/rechtschreibung/Arschkarte"},{"url":"https://www.duden.de/rechtschreibung/Tasche"},{"url":"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arschkarte"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","old":"reach deep into the pocket","new":"draw the arse card"},{"field":"answerDe","old":"tief in die Tasche greifen","new":"die Arschkarte ziehen"},{"field":"answerRu","old":"глубоко залезть в карман","new":"вытянуть задницкую карту"},{"field":"spans","old":{"en":[861,26],"de":[894,26],"ru":[805,24]},"new":{"en":[933,18],"de":[905,21],"ru":[861,24]}},{"field":"source","old":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Penalty_card","title":"Penalty card – Wikipedia","lang":"en"},"new":{"url":"https://www.duden.de/rechtschreibung/Arschkarte","title":"Arschkarte – Duden","lang":"de"}}],"hash":"4d417af7baa7","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"2a31d9cba39f21993aed35264ab64c126a88b20db8e7b399d12d8c1842dbbbc8"},
